 The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank `[REQ-VET-001]`.
 
+<a id="req-vet-003"></a>
+
+The specialty directory is the inverse view. It lists every specialty the clinic knows by its recorded name, each with the veterinarians holding it, all on one page `[REQ-VET-003]`. Each veterinarian appears by first name, then last name. A veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere in it, since it lists specialties rather than the full roster. The directory is read-only and takes no search input. It is reached by its address alone; no navigation entry or link from another page leads to it.
